 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I've been turning something over. What do YOU think actually happened to us?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Something shutters, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Funny thing: Still on what you think happened to us.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Trust me. Mostly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Since Greta died... I keep expecting to see Greta at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Greta said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You show them Serviceberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what's been happening — we left it mid-thought. 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Greta. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You show them Wood Sorrel — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You're one of the good ones. Don't make me regret saying that out loud.\" \"That's where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what you think happened to us — we wandered off it, 7 days back. 'Forget I said anything. What did you want? Trust me. Mostly.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Still on that question.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took you — The Quiet Room, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"What's the kindest thing someone's done for you out here? That's where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "The warmth pulls back a notch. They're weighing something."
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"Still on the kindest thing someone's done for you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Terry owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"I taste the water before the others drink. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "\"Alright, duty calls. This was a good pause.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 34,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
